    lsp_mcp_server_process_leak_2026-07-05, 0, "2026-11-28 Lane D (work/p2-app-lib-fixes-20261128): added graceful JSON-RPC shutdown + exit lifecycle termination in src/app/simple_lsp_mcp/main.spl (breaks stdio loop on exit notification, rejects post-shutdown requests with -32600, exits 0 after shutdown or 1 on abrupt exit, 0 on clean EOF), exported json_tokenize/json_unescape_string in src/lib/common/json/tokenizer.spl, and exported query_cli_get_args/query_* in src/app/cli/query_rich_common.spl. Verified 29/29 PASS: lsp_shutdown_exit_lifecycle_spec (4/4), stdio_dispatch_spec (4/4), lsp_diagnostics_timeout_spec (2/2), lsp_command_bounded_spec (4/4), lsp_query_owned_process_v1_spec (15/15). Native tracked-PID gate lsp_process_lifecycle_test.cjs remains pending qualified native binary. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/app/simple_lsp_mcp/lsp_diagnostics_timeout_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/app/simple_lsp_mcp/lsp_shutdown_exit_lifecycle_spec.spl"
